==English==

===Verb===
''to'' '''[[strike]] [[out]]'''

# {{intransitive}} To [[yield]] nothing, especially for sexual advances.
#: ''Dave '''struck out''' with the blonde.''
# {{intransitive|baseball}} To be retired after three strikes (missed swings, as opposed to any other way of becoming "out.")
#: ''He '''struck out''' on a nasty slider.''
# {{transitive|baseball}} To retire a [[batter]] after three [[strike]]s.
#: ''He '''struck out''' Jones with a nasty slider.''

